{"path":"chemistry/organic/hydrocarbons/molecule-coplanarity","title":"有机物分子共面共线判断","type":"example","html":"<p>下列说法正确的是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 甲烷分子中，四个氢原子与碳原子位于同一平面</p>\n<p>B. 乙烯分子中，所有原子都位于同一平面</p>\n<p>C. 苯分子中，六个碳原子位于同一条直线上</p>\n<p>D. 乙醇分子中，所有原子可以位于同一平面</p>\n<ul>\n<li>模板清单（必须背）：①乙烯 6 原子共面；②乙炔 4 原子共线；③苯 12 原子（6C+6H）共面；④甲烷正四面体；⑤甲醛 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{HCHO}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">HCHO</span></span></span></span></span> 与苯环类似共面（碳是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sp^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 平面）；</li>\n<li>综合分子判断法：把分子拆成模板碎片，<strong>单键连接处可旋转</strong>，只有同时满足&quot;碎片共面 + 键不旋转偏离&quot;才整体共面；</li>\n<li>易错点：&quot;共线&quot;比&quot;共面&quot;更严格——共线必共面，共面不必共线；苯环说&quot;共线&quot;是经典错项；</li>\n<li>变式：问 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CH_4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中&quot;最多几个原子共面&quot;＝ 3（如 C 与任意 2 个 H）——四面体中心碳不落在三个氢所在的面上，说&quot;四个氢与碳共面&quot;是经典错项。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>调取三个基本构型模板</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>甲烷：<strong>正四面体</strong>，键角 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>109.</mn><msup><mn>5</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">109.5^\\circ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">109.</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——任意 3 个原子（三点定面）都共面，但四面体中心碳<strong>不在任意三个氢所在的面上</strong>：四个氢与碳不可能共面，全分子最多 3 个原子共面；</li>\n<li>乙烯：双键碳采取平面构型，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{C_2H_4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 六个原子<strong>共平面</strong>；</li>\n<li>苯：平面正六边形，<strong>六个碳共面</strong>但显然不共线；</li>\n<li>乙醇 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CH_3CH_2OH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">OH</span></span></span></span></span>：甲基是四面体，C—O 单键可以自由旋转且羟基氢可在任意方向——<strong>所有原子不可能共面</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>逐项判断：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A：应是&quot;四面体&quot;，四个氢不可能共面，错；</li>\n<li>B：乙烯分子全部 6 个原子共面 ✓；</li>\n<li>C：苯的六个碳在一个平面上（正六边形），不在一条直线上，错；</li>\n<li>D：乙醇含四面体碳，且—OH 单键旋转，所有原子不可能共面，错。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选 <strong>B</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>&quot;模板+旋转&quot;两秒钟</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>看到共面题，先找模板：<strong>乙烯平面、苯平面、乙炔直线</strong>；再找单键：<strong>单键可旋转的原子群不要假设共面</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>甲烷 4 氢共面？✗（四面体，最多 3 个氢）；</li>\n<li>乙烯全共面？✓（双键模板，直接锁定）；</li>\n<li>苯 6 碳共线？✗（共面≠共线）；</li>\n<li>有单键连接（C—C、C—O）的分子&quot;所有原子共面&quot;？一律 ✗。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>30 秒选 B。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"下列说法正确的是（ ） A. 甲烷分子中，四个氢原子与碳原子位于同一平面 B. 乙烯分子中，所有原子都位于同一平面 C. 苯分子中，六个碳原子位于同一条直线上 D. 乙醇分子中，所有原子可以位于同一平面 模板清单（必须背）：①乙烯 6 原子","source":"自编（经典考法）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"共面判断本质是\"模板拼接+单键旋转\"——乙烯平面、苯平面、乙炔直线是基本模板，单键可旋转处不能假设共面。","fit":["有机物分子空间构型（共面/共线）","甲烷/乙烯/乙炔/苯的构型模板","选填题"],"updated":"Mon Mar 03 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"chemistry","title":"化学"},{"slug":"organic","title":"有机化学基础"},{"slug":"hydrocarbons","title":"烃"},{"slug":"molecule-coplanarity","title":"有机物分子共面共线判断"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"hydrocarbons","title":"烃","type":"knowledge"}]}